    {
      "text": "The cover of a USAID Performance Monitoring & Evaluation \"TIPS\" publication titled \"Building a Results Framework,\" showing the series title, an issue number, and a contents summary including sections \"What is a results framework?\" and \"Why is the results framework important?\"",
